[I] X10 compatibility library

[T] liboldX is a small library providing X10 compatibility functions for old
[T] X clients, such as the association table and XDraw routines. It is
[T] obsolete and only kept for legacy software.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/liboldx

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/x11
[F] CROSS

[L] OpenSource
[V] 1.0.1

[D] 554d77dbb079064266d4e3adf967d7d25d83ac5968e2e62fb3a986d9 liboldX-1.0.1.tar.bz2 https://xorg.freedesktop.org/releases/individual/lib/

. package/*/*/modular-x-conf.in

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -std=gnu89
